OL,3,GNEWSAHunt for descendants of 'most
OL,4,Acourageous' soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historian is working to trace the
OL,7,Fdescendants of a World War One soldier
OL,8,Fwho he believes is "arguably the most
OL,9,Fcourageous man ever born and raised in
OL,10,FSuffolk".
OL,12,FSeveral years ago Gerald Main started
OL,13,Fresearching the names on Hintlesham's
OL,14,Fwar memorial and came across, John
OL,15,FSamuel Gant.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
