OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHunt for descendants of 'most
OL,4,Acourageous' soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FGant, known as Jack, had been born in
OL,7,FWhatfield in 1887 and lived in
OL,8,FHintlesham before he emigrated to
OL,9,FAustralia. He joined the Australian
OL,10,FInfantry in 1916 and served in France,
OL,11,Fwhere he earned the Military Medal for
OL,12,FGallantry.
OL,14,FMain, a former BBC broadcaster who
OL,15,Flives in Suffolk, hopes to find Gant's
OL,16,Fdescendants, as part of a project to
OL,17,Fcreate a lasting tribute to him in
OL,18,FHintlesham.
